sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Application
    participant Cache as Cache
    participant Q as Write Buffer Queue
    participant DB as Database

    rect rgb(220, 255, 220)
        Note over App,DB: WRITE - Ultra fast, async to DB
        App->>Cache: PUT view_count:video_99
        Cache->>Q: Queue write
        Cache-->>App: SUCCESS (microseconds!)
        Note over App: User-facing latency<br/>extremely low
    end
    
    rect rgb(255, 240, 220)
        Note over App,DB: ASYNC BATCH FLUSH
        Note over Q: Trigger - every 5s OR 1000 writes
        Q->>DB: BATCH INSERT/UPDATE (1000 rows)
        DB-->>Q: ACK
        Q->>Q: Remove ACKed writes
    end
    
    rect rgb(220, 220, 255)
        Note over App,DB: READ - From cache always
        App->>Cache: GET view_count:video_99
        Cache-->>App: Return latest value
    end
    
    rect rgb(255, 200, 200)
        Note over App,DB: FAILURE RISK
        App->>Cache: PUT view_count:video_100
        Cache->>Q: Queue write
        Note over Cache: 💥 Cache crashes here
        Note over DB: Queued writes LOST<br/>unless WAL/replication used
    end
